# Build directories produced by the Makefile wrapper.
build/
build-debug/
build-asan/
build-ubsan/
build-tsan/

# CTest's own scratch directory. It is written into whatever directory `ctest`
# is invoked from: `build/Testing/` for the normal `make test` path, and the
# source root for anyone who runs `ctest` from here. Neither is source, and the
# stray one is easy to commit by accident.
Testing/

# Editor/clangd convenience symlink created by `make compiledb`.
compile_commands.json

# Local editor state.
.cache/
*.swp

# Site-local deployment reports: they name a specific machine, its indexed
# repositories and its backup digests, none of which belong in a public repo.
*.local.md

# Site-local deployment scripts, for the same reason: deploy.local.sh names
# this machine's service unit, its install prefix and its build-directory
# owner. The procedure is general; every value in it is not.
*.local.sh
